From 73b536d9b5079c9f8ff81f8bb0b8d7824892f79c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 11:11:27 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Improve site messaging, FAQ, commercial page, and estimate
 form

- Lead with commercial capital improvements as well as remodeling in the
  default title/description, hero copy, CTAs, and homepage card order
- Add named service-area communities (homepage, footer, llms.txt, schema)
  driven by new lib/siteConfig.js
- Add optional phone and credential hooks (hidden until filled in): header,
  mobile menu, footer, form error message, and JSON-LD telephone
- Footer: add "Doing business as McLoud Construction" line
- FAQ: add cost, financing, scope-change, client-portal, and occupied-
  building answers; fix meta description; add FAQPage JSON-LD
- Commercial: add "What You Can Expect" section for property managers with
  W-9 / certificate of insurance request line
- Estimate form: add commercial property type, size, and timeline fields
  (folded into the message so the jobs API contract is unchanged), preselect
  property type from the industry page, add label associations and
  autocomplete attributes
- Sitemap: include /financing
- Add .gitignore

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016mGGrdmqY7PmVyotvMuien
